[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1324","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1324.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1085","title":"SSH 1.2 CBC/CFB模式加密流数据插入攻击漏洞","description":"SSH 1.2.25、1.2.23 及更早版本在使用 CBC（密码块链接）或 CFB（64位密码反馈）加密模式时存在插入攻击漏洞。远程攻击者利用已知明文攻击，可计算出通过 CRC-32 校验的有效数据包，从而在 SSH 客户端与服务器之间的已加密数据流中插入任意数据。该漏洞影响了早期 SSH 协议的多种实现，威胁数据流完整性与机密性。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1085"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-06-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:41Z","remediation":"立即升级至 SSH 2.x 协议（如 OpenSSH 3.4p1 及以上版本），在 sshd_config 中配置 Protocol 2 禁用 SSH-1 协议以彻底规避该漏洞。如无法升级，在服务端配置 Ciphers 禁用 CBC 模式密码（如仅使用 aes128-ctr/aes256-ctr），并启用 HMAC 完整性校验（MACs hmac-sha1），同时禁用压缩和转发代理作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221103125884&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104525878&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/1126.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/13877","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1085.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1085","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1085.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1085.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ssh_insertion.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qfm6-qcw8-g9xg/GHSA-qfm6-qcw8-g9xg.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/phrackzine/articles/blob/02d477c4f24342276683a6150220cf32a7b57929/issues/72/2.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1085.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1324.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1538","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1538.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1480","title":"IBM AIX acledit与aclput 符号链接攻击本地提权漏洞","description":"AIX 4.3 系统中的 acledit 和 aclput 工具存在条件竞争漏洞（Race Condition），本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击（symlink attack）利用该漏洞创建或修改系统文件，从而提升权限或破坏系统完整性。该漏洞影响 AIX 4.3 版本，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 1.2，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1480"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-06-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:31Z","remediation":"建议安装 IBM 提供的对应 APAR 补丁 IX72383（AIX 4.3），或升级至 AIX 5.1 及以上版本。临时缓解措施：使用 `chmod 500 /usr/bin/acledit /usr/bin/aclput` 移除两命令的 setuid 位，或通过 `chgrp` 限制仅允许可信用户执行；亦可移除两文件的 setuid 权限并替换为 sudo 授权方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/429","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/559e7878a2bcd153513c59154e730dfe23ee3b94/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1480.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1480","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1480.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ed836d32ec0f7204df361b2aedfef822b3e814e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1480.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fe37e86b4ab6d44c1acc95d76e30f97043bfd67f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4xg8-7wjx-xrf2/GHSA-4xg8-7wjx-xrf2.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1480.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000309.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/a9112c0eb28ff625236ed69aa7f1f5a20822b356/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--fe6bd280-0e1b-4adb-b517-2e40dd83e2fd.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1538.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1440","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1440.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1271","title":"Macromedia Dreamweaver FTP密码弱加密信息泄露漏洞","description":"Macromedia Dreamweaver 使用弱加密算法存储 FTP 密码，本地攻击者可通过分析加密机制轻易解密其他用户的 FTP 凭据。该漏洞影响多个 Dreamweaver 版本，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，利用难度低。由于加密强度不足，存储的密码可被直接逆向还原，导致敏感凭据泄露。建议升级至修复版本或使用更安全的凭据存储方式。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1271"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-06-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:04Z","remediation":"升级至 Macromedia Dreamweaver MX（6.0）及以上版本，这些版本已改用强加密算法保护 FTP 密码存储。如无法升级，建议不在 Dreamweaver 中保存 FTP 密码，每次手动输入；或改用 FileZilla、WinSCP 等支持加密存储密码的专业 FTP 客户端替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/9511","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1636","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1271.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1271","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1271.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1271.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-293r-f52g-2w34/GHSA-293r-f52g-2w34.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87834/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1271.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--6b93ea56-8deb-434d-897e-a18523c0fa79.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1440.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1303","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1303.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1555","title":"Cheyenne InocuLAN Windows NT 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Cheyenne InocuLAN Anti-Virus Server 4.0 在安装 Service Pack 2 之前创建的更新目录设置了\"Everyone 完全控制\"权限，导致本地攻击者可利用该漏洞将恶意 DLL 文件放置到更新目录中，当杀毒软件执行自动更新时即会加载该恶意 DLL，从而实现以系统权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Inoculan 4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1555"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-06-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:42Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Cheyenne InocuLAN 4.0 Service Pack 2 或更高版本，该版本已修复更新目录默认权限问题。若暂时无法升级，手动修改更新目录（通常位于安装目录下的 Update 子目录）权限，移除 Everyone 组的完全控制权限，仅保留 SYSTEM 和管理员写入权限，同时限制服务器本地登录的普通用户范围，防止非授权用户篡改更新文件植入恶意 DLL。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/9515","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1536","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19083","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1555.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1555","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1555.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1555.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-66v7-mjfq-96pv/GHSA-66v7-mjfq-96pv.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1555.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--716ff60e-b859-41ba-a98f-2b91147668c2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1303.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1377","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1377.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1178","title":"Sambar Sambar Server 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Sambar Server 4.1 beta 版本中存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求访问 dumpenv.pl 脚本，从而获取服务器环境变量、系统路径等敏感配置信息。该漏洞可被用于进一步的信息收集，辅助后续攻击，影响 Sambar Server 4.1 beta 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1178"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-06-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:53Z","remediation":"立即移除或重命名 Sambar Server 安装目录下 cgi-bin 中的 dumpenv.pl 脚本，以防止远程攻击者通过 HTTP 请求获取服务器环境变量等敏感信息。同时将 Sambar Server 升级至 4.1 以上已修复此问题的最新版本（最高至 6.x），并在 Web 服务器前端通过防火墙或反向代理限制对 cgi-bin 目录的未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/9505","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3223","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1178.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1178","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1178.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/228df6a85079f5c6b1ecdfb3d41be685458438ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1178.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7p9v-gcpq-g972/GHSA-7p9v-gcpq-g972.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/dumpenv.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1178.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000307.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1d9ece17-90a6-4a63-9ab0-8f8a22017a0e.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1377.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1377.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1377.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0145","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0145.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0054","title":"Sun Solaris ftpd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 2.3 至 2.6 版本的 ftpd 守护进程存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标系统的 FTP 服务发送特制请求，导致 ftpd 进程崩溃或停止响应，造成服务不可用。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限即可利用，影响范围广泛。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0054"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-06-10T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Sun Solaris 2.3/2.4/2.5/2.5.1/2.6，官方补丁 Sun Security Bulletin #171 已不可用。建议升级至 Solaris 8 或更高版本以获得修复；如无法升级，可禁用 ftpd 服务（编辑 /etc/inetd.conf 注释 ftp 行后重启 inetd），或使用 tcpwrappers 限制可信来源 IP 访问，并在网络边界防火墙封禁 TCP 21 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0054"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0145.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0040","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0008","title":"Sun Solaris NIS+ rpc.nisd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 系统中的 NIS+（网络信息服务增强版）rpc.nisd 守护进程存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的 RPC 请求触发该漏洞，成功利用后可导致拒绝服务或在目标系统上以 root 权限执行任意代码。受影响的版本包括 Solaris 2.3、2.4、2.5 和 2.5.1。该漏洞 CVSS v2 评分为 10.0，属于严重级别。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0008"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-06-08T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Sun 官方在 Security Bulletin #170 中发布了针对 Solaris 2.3/2.4/2.5/2.5.1 的安全补丁。如 NIS+ 服务非业务必需，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释掉 rpc.nisd 条目并重启 inetd 以禁用该服务。同时应在网络边界防火墙阻断对 RPC 端口（111/TCP/UDP）的外部访问。若无法立即打补丁，可结合 TCP Wrappers 配置 hosts.allow/deny 限制可访问 NIS+ 服务的来源 IP。由于相关系统版本已停止支持，建议迁移至替代身份管理方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0008"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1365","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1365.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1152","title":"Compaq/Microcom 6000 Access Integrator 暴力破解漏洞","description":"Compaq/Microcom 6000 Access Integrator 存在认证机制缺陷，系统未限制失败登录尝试次数，远程攻击者可对用户名和密码实施暴力破解攻击，从而获取未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 Compaq/Microcom 6000 系列产品，攻击者无需任何身份认证，通过网络即可进行字典式暴力猜解，严重威胁系统安全。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1152"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-06-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:49Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，建议升级至支持账户锁定策略的现代访问网关设备。如无法替换，可在网络层面限制源 IP 访问（仅允许受信任管理网段），并部署入侵检测系统监控暴力破解行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90296493106214&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1152.json","https://github.com/kenhuangus/llm-wiki/blob/d2bd485921f6c7b6071afbb389f44ab8e4e83c69/wiki/security/cve/cve-1999-1152.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1152","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1152.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1152.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-69gg-qrhh-p73q/GHSA-69gg-qrhh-p73q.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_200_300.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88506/info.html","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-307.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1152.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1365.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1364","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1364.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1151","title":"Compaq Microcom 6000 Access Integrator 会话超时未设置导致远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Compaq Microcom 6000 Access Integrator 存在会话超时机制缺失漏洞。该设备在提示输入用户名或密码后未设置会话超时限制，远程攻击者可通过建立连接但不提供任何认证凭据的方式，长期占用会话资源，导致设备无法处理合法用户的认证请求，从而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Compaq Microcom 6000 系列设备，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1151"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-06-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:49Z","remediation":"该产品已停止支持，无官方补丁可用。建议在网络边界防火墙或 ACL 中限制对 Microcom 6000 管理端口的访问，仅允许受信 IP 连接；同时在设备配置中启用连接超时参数（如 idle-timeout），限制未认证连接的持续时间；或迁移至受支持的替代产品彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90296493106214&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2089","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1151.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1151","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1151.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1151.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-93vv-5jr3-4fvj/GHSA-93vv-5jr3-4fvj.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88484/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1151.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--e7ec9f6b-530e-48a8-85d5-73cf1a4e3904.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1364.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1527","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1527.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1443","title":"Micah Software Full Armor Network Configurator 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Micah Software Full Armor Network Configurator 及 Zero Administration 存在安全绕过漏洞。具有物理访问权限的本地用户可通过三种方式绕过桌面保护：使用 Ctrl+Alt+Del 组合键调出任务管理器终止保护进程、从外部磁盘引导系统绕过启动加载、或在系统引导过程中中断特定执行进程。该漏洞允许低权限攻击者完全绕过系统桌面防护机制获取未授权访问，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1443"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:27Z","remediation":"升级 Micah Software Full Armor 至最新版本，启用 BIOS 密码防止从外部磁盘启动，通过组策略禁用任务管理器（CTRL+ALT+DEL 安全选项），并对物理访问受限的终端实施机箱锁等物理安全措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221103125869&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221103125889&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc228e85e595b2c95bda5544193864b06177c050/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1443.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1443","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1443.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9849013fb49e540f15cffd30644fcdcb875c1d4f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1443.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ffq3-gg7h-pv97/GHSA-ffq3-gg7h-pv97.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/103/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1443.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000304.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e9fb4970-41ba-4efd-abc8-4df9c7d77182.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1527.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0762","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0762.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0508","title":"开源路由器 默认口令 本地安全漏洞","description":"开源路由器、防火墙及其他网络设备上存在账户使用默认密码、空密码或未设置密码的安全漏洞。攻击者若能够通过网络连接到这些设备，即可直接利用这些弱口令或空口令登录系统，无需身份验证即可获得设备管理权限。该漏洞影响各类开源路由器及防火墙设备，CVSS 评分为 4.6，危害等级为中等。攻击者成功利用后可能导致设备配置被篡改、网络流量被劫持或设备被用于发起进一步攻击，建议管理员为所有账户设置强密码并定期更换。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0508"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:32Z","remediation":"登录路由器或防火墙管理界面，修改所有默认/空/弱密码为符合复杂度要求的高强度密码，禁用或删除不必要的默认账户，并启用账户锁定策略以防范暴力破解。如设备已停止更新，建议升级至厂商支持的最新固件版本，或在管理接口前部署访问控制列表(ACL)限制仅可信网络可达。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0508","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c271719fd48dcc28619dc324e441b822d7b4bace/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0508.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0508","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/968abdc74763b43a3cdd216fbb1950cab484f982/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0508.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e2d061a60b9c6823d20cc72e51f709fadad54d2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0508.json","https://github.com/DefectDojo/django-DefectDojo/blob/d9905eb7656178d3e59e0bf8f1d53a9ee9e50186/unittests/scans/openvas/many_vuln.xml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/cisco_no_pw.nasl","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/cve_2_MSF_exploit_Mapping/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/DDI_WhatsUp_Default.nasl","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/3455d6adfb8ec0cc7fbb444ace396770ca5ca6c0/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0762.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0751","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0751.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0501","title":"Unix 账号弱口令漏洞","description":"Unix 系统账户存在可被猜测的弱口令漏洞。系统管理员或用户在创建账户时未设置足够复杂的密码（如空密码、默认密码或字典单词），导致攻击者可通过暴力破解、字典攻击或在线密码猜测等方式，在本地或远程登录场景下利用弱口令成功登录目标系统，获得未授权的 shell 访问权限。该漏洞影响所有 Unix 及类 Unix 操作系统（包括 Linux、BSD、Solaris 等），CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。修复建议为实施强密码策略和账户锁定机制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0501"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:31Z","remediation":"在 /etc/pam.d/ 中配置 pam_cracklib.so 或 pam_pwquality.so 强制密码长度≥8位、含大小写字母和数字，并设置密码有效期≤90天；使用 `passwd -l` 锁定无密码账户，定期用 John the Ripper 审计弱口令；禁用不安全的 DES 加密，改用 SHA-512 密码哈希（`pwconv` 配合 `authconfig` 配置）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0501"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0751.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0544","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0544.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0329","title":"SGI IRIX mediad 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 操作系统中的 mediad（媒体设备管理守护进程）存在权限处理缺陷，本地普通用户可利用该程序的不当权限提升机制，通过执行特制命令或传递恶意参数，绕过系统安全检查，从而获取 root 最高权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 系统，攻击者需拥有本地 shell 访问权限，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级较高。SGI 已于 1998 年 6 月发布安全公告并提供补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0329"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:09Z","remediation":"立即安装 SGI 安全公告 19980602-01-PX 对应补丁，更新 mediad 程序至最新版本。如无法打补丁，临时缓解措施为：以 root 权限执行 `chmod -s /usr/sbin/mediad` 移除该程序的 setuid 位，阻断提权路径。考虑到 SGI IRIX 已停止官方支持，建议迁移至现代受支持操作系统以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0544.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0464","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0464.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0278","title":"Microsoft IIS 及 Personal Web Server ASP 源码泄露漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Microsoft IIS 3.0/4.0 及 Personal Web Server 2.0/3.0/4.0 存在安全漏洞，远程攻击者通过在 URL 后附加「::$DATA」可获取 ASP 文件的源代码。该漏洞利用了 Windows NTFS 文件系统的备用数据流（ADS）特性，导致服务器将 ASP 文件以文本形式返回而非执行，从而泄露数据库连接字符串、业务逻辑等敏感信息。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，影响范围广泛。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0278"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1998-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:03Z","remediation":"tags.\n\nActually, wait - the skill says \"输出格式铁律：下文所有 TOML、PoC、EXP 输出必须且仅包含纯 TOML 文本，不得包裹在 ``` 代码块中\". But the user's message says to put the final answer in <value> tags. So I should put the TOML inside <value> tags without ``` code blocks.\n\nLet me also think about whether I need to provide PoC/EXP TOML files separately. The skill says:\n- 写入 `output/vulns/{year}/{AVE_ID}.toml`\n- 写入 `output/pocs/{year}/POC-{AVE_ID}.toml`（如有 PoC）\n- 写入 `output/exploits/{year}/EXP-{AVE_ID}.toml`（如有 EXP）\n\nSo I need to output the main vulnerability TOML, and optionally PoC and EXP TOMLs.\n\nBut the user's message says to put the final answer in <value> tags. Let me provide all three TOML outputs inside the <value> tags.\n\nActually, re-reading the user's message: \"你可以先简要分析，但最终答案必须放在一对 <value>...\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-003","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A913","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19118","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/1999/CVE-1999-0278.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d92a0abc5d3abac6dcdfabfef6fd71c158e0fd8b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0278.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0278","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/58eef6eedd760f280b47bfb4c94db9995b29c5a0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0278.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0278.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9hfq-647w-q8vp/GHSA-9hfq-647w-q8vp.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0278.yaml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-iis.rules","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/asp_source_data.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0464.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0464.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0464.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1284","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1284.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1490","title":"RedHat xosview 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"xosview 1.5.1 在 Red Hat Linux 5.1 中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过设置超长的 HOME 环境变量触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 5.1 系统中安装了 xosview 1.5.1 的版本，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1490"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-05-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:33Z","remediation":"升级 xosview 至 1.5.1 以上版本，或升级 Red Hat Linux 至 6.0 及以上版本。如无法升级，可移除 xosview 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/X11R6/bin/xosview）或直接卸载该软件包（rpm -e xosview）以消除提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221101926021&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221101926034&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8787.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/362","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19281","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b4109a5f204e995e8b4c403f2d8e63073bf1f4d9/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1490.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1490","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1490.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9a5386d000a40888283d918a46b8928ffcbfca7b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1490.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fe37e86b4ab6d4